idal Judgement,\" a scene on a beach at sunrise.\nI really want to see the scene drawn with the clear air and flowing texture of Mr. Takatani's illustration.\nYou are free to do whatever you like with the composition, color scheme, interpretation, and other details.\nI would appreciate it if you could accompany me in my desire to see Takatani's image. Thank you in advance. Please help me. Kashiko.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@1tktn1/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c48de15e/uploads/origins/7bfb72d4-aa34-444b-8efb-55a5986def8e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cd2866471b34c05fb35d0e36bb1e0a39", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c48de15e/uploads/origins/7bfb72d4-aa34-444b-8efb-55a5986def8e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cd2866471b34c05fb35d0e36bb1e0a39, https://si.imgix.net/c48de15e/uploads/origins/7bfb72d4-aa34-444b-8efb-55a5986def8e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a7874388d911c7c8dd97fcbd80b0a30d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c48de15e/uploads/origins/7bfb72d4-aa34-444b-8efb-55a5986def8e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1af37045395b349982f5387026b53a5b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Please Hisuiku and ...... Sora Blue please ......\nPlease make out with me ...... since I'm a post-grad ......", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}